IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DEEPSEEK-MOE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-EXPERTS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOP-K               PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SHARED-EXPERTS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DEEPSEEK-MOE.
    IF TOTAL-EXPERTS == 0 OR TOP-K == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 582400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-EXPERTS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
